    "summary": "Matched native retained rollcall derives its bitmap from locally enabled endpoint flags, yielding EP32/33 bits for the enabled cold starts. The current v11 final map reply represents no retained applications. A zero reply does not itself prove that firmware endpoint flags were cleared; separate powertransition state remains relevant. Endpoint routing and fresh application-control readiness are separate execution dependencies.",
